  "why": "plumage launch parses peer.json with PeerConfig and deployment.json with the harness Deployment, both deny_unknown_fields. A key outside these lists stops the job at startup. The packer also refuses peer_id, token, advertisement_file and peers, and refuses an embedding. Regenerate when those structs change.",
